'''Voidling Fanatic''' is a neutral [[Mob]] that spawns in the [[Void Sepulture]] within [[The End]]. 

== Behavior ==
Just as with regular [[Endermen]], it won't attack players unless the player provokes it by hitting it or looking directly into its eyes.

